---
import manufacturers from '../data/manufacturers.json';

const SITE = 'https://manufacturer.worldbatteryhub.com';
const items = manufacturers.manufacturers;
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Battery Manufacturer Directory | World Battery Hub</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Battery manufacturer directory — verified company data for lead-acid and lithium battery makers, each with an entity page and a claimed-vs-accredited verification status." />
    <link rel="canonical" href={`${SITE}/`} />
    <style>
      body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 0; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.6; }
      .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
      h1, h2 { color: #0f1f3d; }
      a { color: #1d4ed8; }
      .muted { color: #64748b; font-size: 0.85rem; }
      table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.95rem; }
      th, td { text-align: left; padding: 8px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e9f0; }
      th { color: #0f1f3d; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Battery Manufacturer Directory</h1>
      <p>A directory of battery manufacturers with verified company data. Click a manufacturer for its entity page. Company-level facts are cross-checked; certifications are recorded as claimed until independently accredited.</p>

      <h2>How listings are verified</h2>
      <p>Every listing distinguishes a <em>claim</em> from an <em>independently accredited</em> certification. See the <a href="/verification-criteria/">verification criteria</a> and the <a href="/product-verification/">product-level verification</a> examples.</p>

      <h2>Directory</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Company</th><th>Country</th><th>Chemistry</th><th>Battery types</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {items.map((m) => (
            <tr>
              <td><a href={`/manufacturers/${m.id}/`}><strong>{m.name}</strong>{m.chinese ? ` (${m.chinese})` : ''}</a></td>
              <td>{m.country}</td>
              <td>{m.chemistry}</td>
              <td>{m.products}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>Related</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/china-lead-acid-manufacturers/">China lead-acid battery manufacturers</a> — the majors and the long tail</li>
        <li><a href="/lithium-ev-manufacturers/">Lithium EV battery manufacturers</a> — market share and concentration</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="muted">Return to <a href="https://worldbatteryhub.com">World Battery Hub</a>. Data is researched from public sources and cross-verified; it is informational, not purchasing advice.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
